msgid "RadioLink MiniPix"
msgstr "RadioLink MiniPix"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:8
#: c339a65ad57b48999aa21eec4ab52e56
msgid ""
"This autopilot is not recommended because some versions of the board are not"
" compatible with the official ArduPilot software despite multiple efforts to"
" work with the manufacturer to make them compatible. The manufacturer is "
"also apparently not abiding by the GPLv3 license which requires releasing "
"the modified source code to its customers.  \"V1.0\" and \"V1.2\" probably "
"work, \"V1.0 II\" and \"V1.1\" definitely do not work."
msgstr ""
"不推荐使用此飞控，因为该板的某些版本与官方 ArduPilot 软件不兼容，尽管多次尝试与制造商合作解决兼容性问题。制造商显然也未遵守 GPLv3 "
"许可证（该许可证要求向客户发布修改后的源代码）。「V1.0」和「V1.2」可能可以正常工作，「V1.0 II」和「V1.1」则肯定无法正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:10
#: 6b46a4fcfe504d8f8e4f13106d8c8b48
msgid ""
"The RadioLink CrossFlight is not supported by ArduPilot.  As far as the "
"ArduPilot Development Team is aware, RadioLink are in violation of "
"ArduPilot's GPLv3 license in that they refuse to release the source code for"
" their modifications to ArduPilot.  The Development Team recommend you do "
"not purchase this product, and instead select from one of our many other "
"supported boards."
msgstr ""
"RadioLink CrossFlight 不受 ArduPilot 支持。据 ArduPilot 开发团队所知，RadioLink 违反了 "
"ArduPilot 的 GPLv3 许可证，拒绝发布其对 ArduPilot "
"修改的源代码。开发团队建议不要购买此产品，并请从我们众多其他支持的飞控板中选择。"

