#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:69
#: f6bd0f55f1654445a44db49246e08769
msgid ""
"This hardware comes preflashed with a RadioLink-branded version of "
"ArduCopter and an ArduPilot-compatible bootloader. To use non-branded "
"ChibiOS-based ArduPilot firmware versions, download the required vehicle "
"firmware .apj file from https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ and flash your board"
" using MissionPlanner's \"custom firmware\" option."
msgstr ""
"此硬件出厂时预装了 RadioLink 品牌版本的 ArduCopter 和 ArduPilot 兼容引导程序。要使用非品牌的基于 ChibiOS 的 "
"ArduPilot 固件版本，请从 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ 下载所需的飞行器固件 .apj 文件，并使用 "
"Mission Planner 的「自定义固件」选项刷入您的飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:71
#: fdfb50c62a1a4d6ba1c39f9cd593f111
msgid ""
"In case a bootloader re-installation is required, you can boot your board to"
" DFU-mode using the following solder-points:"
msgstr "如果需要重新安装引导程序，可以使用以下焊点将飞控板启动到 DFU 模式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:76
#: 4a202cd7961247f086ace7a3cea9f28d
msgid ""
"Then follow the instructions on how to :ref:`load firmware onto ChibiOS "
"boards <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`."
msgstr ""
"然后按照 :ref:`向 ChibiOS 飞控板加载固件 <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-"
"boards>` 的说明操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:80
#: de254a0c5c854d1fa3ccc0aecf78e8b6
msgid ""
"The flightcontroller's plastic case shows the telemetry ports' numbers "
"reversed compared to the board's PCB imprints and the firmware's SERIALn "
"assignments, this requires additional attention!"
msgstr "飞控的塑料外壳上显示的数传接口编号与飞控 PCB 印刷和固件 SERIALn 分配相比是反向的，需要特别注意！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolink-minipix.rst:84
#: 6c596acf55504882b624fcbbab422361
msgid ""
"MiniPix voltage and current sensing pins use Pixhawk standard ( "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 2, "
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 3). The "
"additional ADC pin can be used for either RSSI or analog airspeed. Set "
"required option to PIN = 11."
msgstr ""
"MiniPix 电压和电流感测引脚使用 Pixhawk "
"标准（:ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"2，:ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 3）。附加 ADC "
"引脚可用于 RSSI 或模拟空速。将所需选项设置为 PIN = 11。"
